(6148211, 906457, 60915, '<td valign="top">This is great, there could be so many things happening above the waist. Are they kissing? or whispering something in her ear? maybe licking the side of her face...this is what I love about this kind of crop, the mind can fill in the blanks : )</td>', 'This is great, there could be so many things happening above the waist. Are they kissing? or whispering something in her ear? maybe licking the side of her face...this is what I love about this kind of crop, the mind can fill in the blanks : )', '2010-09-01 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
