(6148357, 906834, 120058, '<td valign="top">I somehow like the picture, but it gives me a headache because I don''t know where to look, at all. It''s too much going on in the picture, everywhere. Want to give it more, but I can''t. 3</td>', 'I somehow like the picture, but it gives me a headache because I don''t know where to look, at all. It''s too much going on in the picture, everywhere. Want to give it more, but I can''t. 3', '2010-09-01 11:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6148360, 906743, 120058, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what''s going on in the middle of the picture (on the concrete wall, shadows not aligned) but ut''s the wall, isn''t it? First I thought it was two pictures that wasn''t aligned, but it''s just the wall. I see. Took me a minute or two to get that. <br/> <br/>But I like the picture. 6</td>', 'Don''t know what''s going on in the middle of the picture (on the concrete wall, shadows not aligned) but ut''s the wall, isn''t it? First I thought it was two pictures that wasn''t aligned, but it''s just the wall. I see. Took me a minute or two to get that.  But I like the picture. 6', '2010-09-01 11:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
