(6149871, 906558, 112828, '<td valign="top">Out of all of the images in this challenge with the "signature <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Nixter</a> border" style, this is by far the most complex and well done shot.  The exposure seems to be very inline with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Nixter</a>''s style.<br/> <br/>After much deliberation, I am naming this image as my guess for the "Genuine <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Nixter</a>" image.<br/> <br/>I''m probably wrong, but this image is very right.</td>', 'Out of all of the images in this challenge with the "signature  Nixter border" style, this is by far the most complex and well done shot.  The exposure seems to be very inline with  Nixter''s style. After much deliberation, I am naming this image as my guess for the "Genuine  Nixter" image. I''m probably wrong, but this image is very right.', '2010-09-02 15:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150166, 906030, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love this photo and It''s one of my top three!<br/> <br/>I''m fairly certain this is not near Perth (or any Australian beach) but it does have a Mediterranean feel and I believe Nixter may have been around there when this challenge was announced.  What I''m getting at is that the location may be trying to throw me off but I feel that this may be Nixter.  If not, for me you have definetly captured his style!  Well done - 9.</td>', 'I love this photo and It''s one of my top three! I''m fairly certain this is not near Perth (or any Australian beach) but it does have a Mediterranean feel and I believe Nixter may have been around there when this challenge was announced.  What I''m getting at is that the location may be trying to throw me off but I feel that this may be Nixter.  If not, for me you have definetly captured his style!  Well done - 9.', '2010-09-02 20:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
