(6151485, 905592, 60915, '<td valign="top">A little slice of everyday life. I don''t know about you, but I always get a little excited when I get mail, even though most of the time it''s just bills...<br/>She seems disappointed the mail box was empty : )</td>', 'A little slice of everyday life. I don''t know about you, but I always get a little excited when I get mail, even though most of the time it''s just bills...She seems disappointed the mail box was empty : )', '2010-09-03 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
