(6151487, 906200, 60915, '<td valign="top">I was just there in June!! I even went on the boat! : )<br/>Nice work shooting into the sun and catching the boat in the reflection! : )</td>', 'I was just there in June!! I even went on the boat! : )Nice work shooting into the sun and catching the boat in the reflection! : )', '2010-09-03 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
