(6151650, 906486, 60915, '<td valign="top">Dang! These shadows are incredible! I''m a little jealous that you''ve found this location : )<br/>It''s really giving my brain a workout trying to figure out how they''re being cast.</td>', 'Dang! These shadows are incredible! I''m a little jealous that you''ve found this location : )It''s really giving my brain a workout trying to figure out how they''re being cast.', '2010-09-04 05:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151651, 906603, 60915, '<td valign="top">Interesting expressions on their faces, they both have the same look, but it doesn''t appear to be a happy one. I get the feeling the girl doesn''t want to be there and that this is a just a chore. The elderly lady can sense this, and doesn''t like the girl very much. The other guy that usually takes her on her Sunday walk is much nicer...<br/>or maybe is just the sun in their face... : )</td>', 'Interesting expressions on their faces, they both have the same look, but it doesn''t appear to be a happy one. I get the feeling the girl doesn''t want to be there and that this is a just a chore. The elderly lady can sense this, and doesn''t like the girl very much. The other guy that usually takes her on her Sunday walk is much nicer...or maybe is just the sun in their face... : )', '2010-09-04 05:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151653, 906375, 60915, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dark tones. I feel like I''ve just arrived at a meeting point and the other person isn''t there yet... or perhaps they just left : )</td>', 'Beautiful dark tones. I feel like I''ve just arrived at a meeting point and the other person isn''t there yet... or perhaps they just left : )', '2010-09-04 06:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151654, 906502, 60915, '<td valign="top">That''s some wild hair! : )<br/>They seem to me interested in something or someone just out of frame... probably the accountant with the broken glasses and pens in his pocket : )</td>', 'That''s some wild hair! : )They seem to me interested in something or someone just out of frame... probably the accountant with the broken glasses and pens in his pocket : )', '2010-09-04 06:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151655, 906459, 60915, '<td valign="top">This one worked like one of those mind trick illusions. At first I thought he was standing on a platform that was sticking out towards the viewer, then after a little while I realised we''re looking through an opening. Cool! : )</td>', 'This one worked like one of those mind trick illusions. At first I thought he was standing on a platform that was sticking out towards the viewer, then after a little while I realised we''re looking through an opening. Cool! : )', '2010-09-04 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
