(6151662, 905979, 60915, '<td valign="top">There''s so many wonderful elements in this shot. Definitely one to linger over. The group of ladies gets our attention first, probably discussing the weather and enjoying the afternoon sun. But then the eye wanders over the rest of the image, finding people going about their business, and the more you look the more you see. Fantastic! : )</td>', 'There''s so many wonderful elements in this shot. Definitely one to linger over. The group of ladies gets our attention first, probably discussing the weather and enjoying the afternoon sun. But then the eye wanders over the rest of the image, finding people going about their business, and the more you look the more you see. Fantastic! : )', '2010-09-04 06:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151663, 906770, 60915, '<td valign="top">I look at this a get a sense of determination! Beautifully captured and processed. : )</td>', 'I look at this a get a sense of determination! Beautifully captured and processed. : )', '2010-09-04 06:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151666, 906816, 120675, '<td valign="top">I like how you picked up on the bike that nixter used in several images while finding a different perspective to shoot. Plus the use of the shadows that he uses a lot.</td>', 'I like how you picked up on the bike that nixter used in several images while finding a different perspective to shoot. Plus the use of the shadows that he uses a lot.', '2010-09-04 07:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151667, 905631, 120675, '<td valign="top">There''s often a lot of movement - real or implied - in nixter''s images which you picked up on well here. Great image.</td>', 'There''s often a lot of movement - real or implied - in nixter''s images which you picked up on well here. Great image.', '2010-09-04 07:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151668, 906535, 120675, '<td valign="top">Bit of a throwback to Feblurrary. Well done.</td>', 'Bit of a throwback to Feblurrary. Well done.', '2010-09-04 07:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
