(6152000, 905608, 94241, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful puddle, but I think it needs a human element.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful puddle, but I think it needs a human element.', '2010-09-04 17:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152008, 906850, 94241, '<td valign="top">Great approach, it just seems like the story is a little confused.  I''m not sure if it''s because I want one of the people to be un-blurred enough to see what''s happening, or I want more separation of tones between foreground and background.  I think either one or the other would make this tell a clearer story.</td>', 'Great approach, it just seems like the story is a little confused.  I''m not sure if it''s because I want one of the people to be un-blurred enough to see what''s happening, or I want more separation of tones between foreground and background.  I think either one or the other would make this tell a clearer story.', '2010-09-04 17:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152015, 906154, 94241, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing shot.  I just wish there weren''t raindrops on the lens.  It''s a cool effect, but I think it just distracts from the model''s face and hair.</td>', 'Absolutely amazing shot.  I just wish there weren''t raindrops on the lens.  It''s a cool effect, but I think it just distracts from the model''s face and hair.', '2010-09-04 17:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152031, 905791, 94241, '<td valign="top">I think if the subject was half a footstep farther forward it would add an element to this.  1. It would help tie his shadow into the shadow of the environment.  2. It would put a light tone of wall behind his head instead of the black tone of the window, which he kind of gets lost in.  I know I''m being nitpicky.  Nice shot.  :)</td>', 'I think if the subject was half a footstep farther forward it would add an element to this.  1. It would help tie his shadow into the shadow of the environment.  2. It would put a light tone of wall behind his head instead of the black tone of the window, which he kind of gets lost in.  I know I''m being nitpicky.  Nice shot.  :)', '2010-09-04 18:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152035, 906646, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed.  I just feel it''s too direct, too much a posed model shot.  Nixter I think does a lot of candid, journalistic, participant observer, stuff.<br/> <br/>I love your control of shadow tones, very precise.  I would suggest in post lightening the shadows in some regions and letting them chunk up in others.  I think Nixter does that sometimes, to help add weight to the main subject and let the rest of the background fade away.</td>', 'Beautifully executed.  I just feel it''s too direct, too much a posed model shot.  Nixter I think does a lot of candid, journalistic, participant observer, stuff. I love your control of shadow tones, very precise.  I would suggest in post lightening the shadows in some regions and letting them chunk up in others.  I think Nixter does that sometimes, to help add weight to the main subject and let the rest of the background fade away.', '2010-09-04 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152073, 905488, 60915, '<td valign="top">The blur makes this an extremely moving portrait.<br/>The wonderful muted tones add to the emotion. fantastic! : )</td>', 'The blur makes this an extremely moving portrait.The wonderful muted tones add to the emotion. fantastic! : )', '2010-09-04 20:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152074, 905989, 60915, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of cat photo''s, but this one really appeals to me. I think it''s the texture of the glass/plastic. I''m getting the feeling they''re in a plastic bag, you know, like when you get goldfish from a pet store?! : ) For me it''s surreal and a little disturbing...and I like that! : )</td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of cat photo''s, but this one really appeals to me. I think it''s the texture of the glass/plastic. I''m getting the feeling they''re in a plastic bag, you know, like when you get goldfish from a pet store?! : ) For me it''s surreal and a little disturbing...and I like that! : )', '2010-09-04 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152075, 906853, 60915, '<td valign="top">Such a pleasing composition, and that expression is priceless! : )</td>', 'Such a pleasing composition, and that expression is priceless! : )', '2010-09-04 20:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152076, 906691, 60915, '<td valign="top">This one caught me by surprise, I didn''t see your reflection at first, then it appeared as if by magic! Love it! : )</td>', 'This one caught me by surprise, I didn''t see your reflection at first, then it appeared as if by magic! Love it! : )', '2010-09-04 20:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
