(6152078, 906535, 60915, '<td valign="top">Wonderful comp, and I love the two objects on the right with their own "hats" : )</td>', 'Wonderful comp, and I love the two objects on the right with their own "hats" : )', '2010-09-04 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152079, 906751, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, love the comp. Makes me want to know what he''s thinking. : )</td>', 'Great portrait, love the comp. Makes me want to know what he''s thinking. : )', '2010-09-04 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152181, 906450, 94241, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  For Nixter''s style though, I think it has too much contrast, at least all over.  Something I think he frequently does is bring up the detail in the shadows for parts of the image, then increase the contrast and chunk up the shadows in other parts of the image, to help anchor the most important parts in the deepest black.  I feel there''s too much chunked up black all over here, and the man just kind of gets lost in all of them.</td>', 'Fantastic image.  For Nixter''s style though, I think it has too much contrast, at least all over.  Something I think he frequently does is bring up the detail in the shadows for parts of the image, then increase the contrast and chunk up the shadows in other parts of the image, to help anchor the most important parts in the deepest black.  I feel there''s too much chunked up black all over here, and the man just kind of gets lost in all of them.', '2010-09-04 22:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152185, 906014, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea, beautiful execution.<br/> <br/>I love the duotone.  I think Nick doesn''t use duotones much, but it adds so much to a shot like this, who can argue?</td>', 'Beautiful idea, beautiful execution. I love the duotone.  I think Nick doesn''t use duotones much, but it adds so much to a shot like this, who can argue?', '2010-09-04 22:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152386, 905631, 57447, '<td valign="top">Don''t know enough aboit Nixter style but know enough to say I like this!</td>', 'Don''t know enough aboit Nixter style but know enough to say I like this!', '2010-09-05 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
