(6153552, 905791, 108069, '<td valign="top">For all I can tell this photo belongs to nixter. If the summer album is anything to go by, it is for sure. Similar setting, natural randomness, interesting crop, no normalization by leveling anything. Regardless it''s a really cool photo. But for how well it fits the challenge I have to give it a 10. Nice one.</td>', 'For all I can tell this photo belongs to nixter. If the summer album is anything to go by, it is for sure. Similar setting, natural randomness, interesting crop, no normalization by leveling anything. Regardless it''s a really cool photo. But for how well it fits the challenge I have to give it a 10. Nice one.', '2010-09-06 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
