(6154291, 906720, 60915, '<td valign="top">She looks sad, perhaps she doesn''t want to leave...<br/>Composition and hint of blur works well here. : )</td>', 'She looks sad, perhaps she doesn''t want to leave...Composition and hint of blur works well here. : )', '2010-09-07 05:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154293, 906451, 60915, '<td valign="top">Simple lines and nice contrasts, between the hard lines of the table and soft sofa, make this a very pleasant composition! : )</td>', 'Simple lines and nice contrasts, between the hard lines of the table and soft sofa, make this a very pleasant composition! : )', '2010-09-07 05:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154298, 906392, 60915, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Has a bit of a vintage feel with the retro style swimsuit/underwear.<br/>Tunnels are a great place to shoot! : )</td>', 'Lovely! Has a bit of a vintage feel with the retro style swimsuit/underwear.Tunnels are a great place to shoot! : )', '2010-09-07 05:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154299, 905997, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lovin'' the space!! : )</td>', 'Great composition, lovin'' the space!! : )', '2010-09-07 05:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154305, 905524, 60915, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this a number of times now, and it becomes more complex every time I look at it. The alien form on the right, with it''s strange eye wear, seems to have subdued the humanoid in preparation for the abduction. Who knows what strange experiments they will perform...</td>', 'I''ve looked at this a number of times now, and it becomes more complex every time I look at it. The alien form on the right, with it''s strange eye wear, seems to have subdued the humanoid in preparation for the abduction. Who knows what strange experiments they will perform...', '2010-09-07 05:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154310, 905767, 60915, '<td valign="top">something about guitar cases on the street, that''s appealing. I guess they''re the musical version of the bicycle?! : )</td>', 'something about guitar cases on the street, that''s appealing. I guess they''re the musical version of the bicycle?! : )', '2010-09-07 05:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154311, 906014, 60915, '<td valign="top">Straight from greek mythology! Beautiful blur! : )</td>', 'Straight from greek mythology! Beautiful blur! : )', '2010-09-07 05:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154313, 905538, 60915, '<td valign="top">This is great, there should be more portraits shot into the sun. I don''t know why, but I always think of the 60''s with this type of into the sun shot. : )</td>', 'This is great, there should be more portraits shot into the sun. I don''t know why, but I always think of the 60''s with this type of into the sun shot. : )', '2010-09-07 06:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6154352, 906643, 30364, '<td valign="top">This gets more witty each time I look.  Despair, the empty chairs, and yet the graph''s growth curve swoops upward.  I suppose he sold short.  This is my top pick.<br/>Some might say it''s not in the style of nixter (not B&amp;W; not perhaps as elegantly reductive as the nix; blah blah) but I don''t think he''d think that.  It has his spirt all right; his sly wit and his deft visual echoes.</td>', 'This gets more witty each time I look.  Despair, the empty chairs, and yet the graph''s growth curve swoops upward.  I suppose he sold short.  This is my top pick.Some might say it''s not in the style of nixter (not B&W; not perhaps as elegantly reductive as the nix; blah blah) but I don''t think he''d think that.  It has his spirt all right; his sly wit and his deft visual echoes.', '2010-09-07 06:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
